---
<Base title="Contact"><PageIntro title="Choose the right path." description="Product support, bug reports, and commercial questions need different handling and clear expectations." /><section class="content-section"><h2>Contact options</h2><div class="outcome-list"><article><h3>Product support</h3><p>Verified users can open a support request and follow its status from the product portal.</p><a class="secondary-button" href="/support">Open support</a></article><article><h3>Project questions</h3><p>A copied project must replace this text with a configured business contact before release.</p><a class="secondary-button" href="/docs">Review documentation</a></article></div></section><section class="content-section"><h2>Response expectations</h2><p>Do not publish invented response times. Add a real support policy, contact destination, spam controls, and operating owner before Production.</p></section></Base>
